{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hollow maid still lives in the Daily Executive Programming Operating System. This time, when you log on, she's nowhere to be found and the UI is completely different. &quot;im not supposed to be here: or anywhere&quot; is the sequel to poetic horror point and click simulation game, &quot;im not supposed to be here.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~20 minutes of point and click gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >content warnings: themes of depression and general anguish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Ren'py.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by a solo developer and published by Titanomachy RPG, a tabletop RPG publisher now branching into video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LK Valentine, AKA Lex K Bobrow is a poet and game designer from Florida.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560440?t=1764522491","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560440?t=1764522491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560440/f76abc2aab865ad06261a63e9b06eaeabfdf5935/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764522491","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560440/f76abc2aab865ad06261a63e9b06eaeabfdf5935/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764522491","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game focuses heavily on themes of depression, struggles with mental health, and chronic illness."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hollow maid still liv